WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.489 --> 00:00:02.950
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:09.769
Today I am going to explain a South Korean
Tv mini series called “Nightmare Teacher.”

00:00:09.769 --> 00:00:11.140
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:17.240
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:22.439
At the beginning of the episode, a high school
student named Do Do-Hee is standing before

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.580
a mirror.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.840
She nervously assures herself that everything
will be fine the next morning and whatever

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.439
is happening is just a dream.

00:00:30.439 --> 00:00:33.050
She is a student at Yosang high school.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:37.500
The high school has its own website where
students upload pictures of daily activities

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.800
happening in the school for entertainment
and educational purposes.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.690
Two students are checking the website and
reading the news about their teacher falling

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.070
down the stairs.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:52.400
They also read about someone named L, dating
a student model of the school named C. The

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.940
website has hidden their names to protect
their privacy but the comments clearly say

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.361
that L is a handsome senior Lee Jong Suk and
C is the freshmen school model, Cheon Yoo

00:01:03.361 --> 00:01:04.600
na.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.380
Even though Yoo na is in her first year, she
has become very popular in the school which

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.920
makes the popular senior girls jealous.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:18.320
Moreover, Lee Jong Suk already has a girlfriend
named Do Do-Hee, so the controversy attracts

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.020
everyone’s attention.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:24.170
Do Do-Hee is with two of her friends, hanging
out in the cafeteria.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:28.009
They have also heard the rumors about her
boyfriend’s affair with a freshman.

00:01:28.009 --> 00:01:32.860
Her friends talk badly about Cheon Yoo na,
claiming that her beauty is nothing compared

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.090
to their friend’s.

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:38.799
Do Do-Hee thanks her friends for the support
but she is clearly bothered by the rumors

00:01:38.799 --> 00:01:41.240
of her boyfriend dating someone else.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:46.100
Her day gets even worse when the janitor removes
her poster from the notice board and replaces

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:50.219
it with the new one with Cheon Yoo na and
Lee Jong Suk on it.

00:01:50.219 --> 00:01:55.070
The other girls can’t help but compliment
the picture making Do Do-Hee jealous.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:02:00.359
They quickly recover and claim that Cheon
Yoo na looks awkward in the picture but Do

00:02:00.359 --> 00:02:02.159
Do-Hee leaves right after.

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:07.590
When the girls are alone, they agree that
Yoo na and Lee Jong Suk make a better couple.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:10.970
Do Do-Hee goes to the washroom to touch up
her makeup.

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:16.530
She has been bothered by her deteriorating
skin recently and doesn’t feel pretty anymore.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:21.780
As she looks at her face in the mirror, counting
her imperfections, some girls outside scream

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.610
and run in a direction.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:28.260
It turns out that the girls are following
Lee Jong suk, the most popular guy in school

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.460
and Do Do-Hee’s boyfriend.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:35.220
Do Do-Hee and Lee Jong Suk have been having
relationship trouble for the past week.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.110
The girls follow Lee Jong Suk around while
taking his pictures.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:43.310
He, however, ignores them all and stares at
Do Do-Hee.

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:46.140
She looks away from him, clearly annoyed.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:51.540
They meet at the rooftop later where Lee Jong
Suk suggests they spend some time apart because

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.790
they have been arguing a lot lately.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:58.070
Do Do-Hee is in utter disbelief because she
had thought he would learn his lesson and

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:02.040
come running back to her if she ignored him
for some days.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.770
She blames everything on the freshman Cheon
Yoo na and asks him if he is really cheating

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:07.770
on her.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.730
Lee Jong Suk claims that those are just rumors.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:15.610
Before he can add anything else, Do Do-Hee
asks him to not talk to her again because

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.620
they have officially broken up.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:27.780
Before leaving, she declares that she broke
up with him and not the other way round.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.710
In one of the classes, two people discuss
how many students have been not coming to

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.290
school for the past few days.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.170
Several seats are empty which they think is
weird.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:42.120
While returning from the rooftop, Do Do-Hee
bumps into a new teacher in their school named

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.720
Oh Ki Chul.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:48.980
She ignores him, making her way to the classroom
but Oh Ki Chul turns around and looks at Do

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.120
Do-Hee in curiosity.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:55.560
After lunch, Do Do-Hee again goes to the washroom
to touch up her makeup.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:04:00.040
She starts to hear noises of people telling
her she is not beautiful enough for Lee Jong

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:04.020
Suk and that Yoo na will take her place in
the school.

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:08.400
Do Do-Hee has to remind herself who she is
while looking at the mirror.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:14.290
As she recites positive affirmations to herself,
she gets a text from an unknown number.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:18.659
Someone has sent her the link to a beauty
app called my cam perfect.

00:04:18.659 --> 00:04:22.109
Do Do-Hee doesn’t think much about it and
clicks on the link.

00:04:22.109 --> 00:04:25.409
It then redirects her to a beauty and editing
app.

00:04:25.409 --> 00:04:28.350
She takes a picture of herself and starts
to edit it.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:34.949
She makes her acne scars go away, her skin
brighter, and her lips fuller and pink.

00:04:34.949 --> 00:04:42.490
She also edits makeup on the picture and looks
at it in admiration, thinking if only she

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.949
looked like that.

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:48.650
But what Do Do-Hee doesn’t notice is that
as she is applying several effects to her

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:55.299
picture, the effects also apply to her face
in real life.

00:04:55.299 --> 00:04:59.319
While waking out of the washroom, she glances
at the mirror and is surprised to see her

00:04:59.319 --> 00:05:03.639
beautiful face that was dull and colorless
a few minutes ago.

00:05:03.639 --> 00:05:08.270
Even when she returns to the classroom, she
cannot stop staring at herself in a hand mirror,

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:11.199
not being able to comprehend what just happened.

00:05:11.199 --> 00:05:15.129
Her friends notice the change in her face
and ask her what shade of lipstick she is

00:05:15.129 --> 00:05:18.830
wearing but Do Do-Hee states that she isn’t
wearing one.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.770
The other students are also mesmerized by
her beauty.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:26.879
They take her picture and upload it to the
website where the entire school admires her.

00:05:26.879 --> 00:05:30.639
Some comment that she might be wearing a lot
of makeup while the others claim the picture

00:05:30.639 --> 00:05:36.000
is edited but the majority of the students
have changed sides from Cheon Yoo na to Do

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.560
Do-Hee, saying that she looks better with
Lee Jong Suk.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:44.979
Later, Lee Jong Suk stops her in the hallways
and asks her to get back together with him.

00:05:44.979 --> 00:05:50.090
He clearly regrets breaking up with her, now
that she has regained her position and popularity

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.090
back.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:56.009
Do Do-Hee simply asks him to go back to Cheon
Yoo na and tries to walk away.

00:05:56.009 --> 00:05:59.150
But Lee Jong Suk is adamant about getting
her back.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:04.080
He even admits that he cares for Yoo na but
claims that he only loves her.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:07.449
Even then, Do Do-Hee doesn’t accept his
apology.

00:06:07.449 --> 00:06:15.560
As the last resort, Lee Jong Suk kneels down
in front of her asking for forgiveness.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.789
Everyone around them gasps in shock.

00:06:17.789 --> 00:06:22.199
An embarrassed Do Do-Hee reluctantly tells
him that she accepts his apology to make him

00:06:22.199 --> 00:06:23.639
stand up.

00:06:23.639 --> 00:06:28.539
Just then, she gets a notification saying
that her evaluation period for my cam perfect

00:06:28.539 --> 00:06:30.319
app has expired.

00:06:30.319 --> 00:06:34.349
It turns out that the version she was using
was only the trial version.

00:06:34.349 --> 00:06:37.669
Because of this, the effects will only last
for a few minutes.

00:06:37.669 --> 00:06:41.349
She immediately excuses herself and runs to
a bathroom stall.

00:06:41.349 --> 00:06:45.960
She receives another notification that says
the trial has ended and her face goes back

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.560
to the original form.

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:52.219
Without hesitating, she texts the number back
and asks how she can buy the regular version

00:06:52.219 --> 00:06:53.229
of the app.

00:06:53.229 --> 00:06:57.770
Now that she has gotten the taste of attention
she would get if she were prettier, she doesn’t

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.900
want to go back.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:03.770
Do Do-Hee hopefully waits for a reply holding
her phone in a tight grip.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:08.110
Only some seconds later, she gets a reply
asking her to go to the consulting room if

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.039
she wants to buy the full version of the app.

00:07:11.039 --> 00:07:15.749
In the consulting room, she meets the new
teacher Oh Ki Chul, who she had bumped into

00:07:15.749 --> 00:07:16.860
that morning.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:22.229
He confidently asks her if she liked the trial
version and if she really wants the full version.

00:07:22.229 --> 00:07:28.110
Do Do-Hee doesn’t answer the question and
in turn, inquires how he knows about the app.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:33.120
She soon realises that the teacher was the
one who sent her the text in the first place.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:36.960
He reveals that he doesn’t know who made
the app but there are some conditions she

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.559
has to fulfill to gain access to the official
version.

00:07:40.559 --> 00:07:46.139
A confused Do Do-Hee asks him what the conditions
are when she gets a little cut on her finger

00:07:46.139 --> 00:07:47.330
out of nowhere.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:52.349
A drop of blood falls onto the papers in front
of her and turns into letters.

00:07:52.349 --> 00:07:56.050
Do Do-Hee has officially signed the contract
to use the app.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:08:01.369
In the last scene, she is seen walking into
a mirror, unknown that she just made a deal

00:08:01.369 --> 00:08:04.400
with the devil.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:09.069
Subscribe for more videos like this, turn
on the notification, and leave a like to help

00:08:09.069 --> 00:08:10.069
the channel out.

00:08:10.069 --> 00:08:10.469
Thanks for watching.

